# 14. Kubernetes Services

Three internal ClusterIP Services were created.

## Backend

```text
backend-service
ClusterIP
Port: 3000
```

## Frontend

```text
frontend-service
ClusterIP
Port: 80
```

## MongoDB

```text
mongodb-service
ClusterIP
Port: 27017
```

The Services provide stable Kubernetes DNS names even if the individual Pods are recreated.

